\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFOCUS\r\n\r\n└── Backend → Node → Express → REST → DB\r\n\r\n&#x20;   └── React only for full-stack roles\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPROOF\r\n\r\n├── Projects → API → Auth → DB → Deployment\r\n\r\n└── Experience → ML internship → Web internships\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\\---------------\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ntest 180826\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI'm Yash Sharma\r\n\r\nI completed my bsc in physics and then pursed Masters of computer application\r\n\r\nMy primary focus is backend developement, particularly\r\n\r\n&#x09;node.js\r\n\r\n&#x09;express.js\r\n\r\n&#x09;REST API\r\n\r\n&#x09;dbs like\r\n\r\n&#x09;\tmongodb\r\n\r\n&#x09;\tpostgresql\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI've build bk focused project with\r\n\r\n&#x09;rest api\r\n\r\n&#x09;authentication\r\n\r\n&#x09;dbs oprn\r\n\r\n&#x09;file handling\r\n\r\n&#x09;deployement.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI've also gained the experience in ML as well as web dev,\r\n\r\n&#x09;currently continuing another internship.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI've been focusing on\r\n\r\n&#x09;building production side backend system and\r\n\r\n&#x09;strengthning my understanding of\r\n\r\n&#x09;\tapis\r\n\r\n&#x09;\tdbs\r\n\r\n&#x09;\tscalability\r\n\r\n&#x09;\tperformance.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI'm yash sharma\r\n\r\nI've compleletd my bsc with physiscs and pursuide masterws of computer applciation I\r\n\r\nMy primary focus on backend developement particularly\r\n\r\n&#x09;node js\r\n\r\n&#x09;express js\r\n\r\n&#x09;rest apis\r\n\r\n&#x09;dbs like\r\n\r\n&#x09;\tmongodb\r\n\r\n&#x09;\tpostgresql\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI've build backend focused project with\r\n\r\n&#x09;rest apis\r\n\r\n&#x09;authentication\r\n\r\n&#x09;db operations\r\n\r\n&#x09;file handling\r\n\r\n&#x09;deployement\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI've also gained the experince in ML as well as web devellpeemnt\r\n\r\n&#x09;currently continuing the anotehr internship\r\n\r\n&#x09;\r\n\r\nI've been focusing on\r\n\r\n&#x09;building production side bk system and\r\n\r\n&#x09;strenghthing my underst