n the terms of reference and as conferred \nupon CSR Committee as prescribed under the Act from time to time.\n Composition\nName of memberPositionCategory\nSanjeev Bikhchandani\n1\nChairmanNominee Director\nDeepinder Goyal\n2\nChairmanManaging Director & Chief Executive Officer\nAparna Popat VedMemberIndependent Director\nNamita GuptaMemberIndependent Director\n1\nSanjeev Bikhchandani has been appointed as the chairman and member of the committee effective from February 10, 2026.\n2\nDeepinder Goyal resigned as Director, Managing Director & Chief Executive Officer of the Company and chairman & member of committee \neffective from the close of business hours on February 1, 2026. Further, while he has been appointed as Vice Chairman & Non-Executive \nDirector of the Company, he is not a member of the committee.\n170\nFinancial StatementsStatutory Reports: CGR\nCompany Overview\n\n Number of meetings held and attendance of the members\nDuring the financial year under review, the CSR Committee met 1 (one) time. The date of meeting held and \nattendance of the members are as follows:\nName of member\nDetails of meeting\nJuly 18, 2025\nDeepinder Goyal\nAparna Popat Ved\nNamita Gupta\n Present   Absent  NA\nInvestment Committee (“IC”)\nThe Board voluntarily constituted the IC, inter-alia, to oversee the investment portfolios of the Company. The \nterms of reference of the committee are aligned with the requirements as approved by the Board.\n\n Brief Description of terms of reference\n\t\n   Review  the  portfolio  to  assess  investment  performance  against  business  operations  and  changing  \nmarket environment;\n\t\n  Review and approve the amendment in the investment policy, as necessary.\n Composition\nName of member Position Category\nSanjeev Bikhchandani\n1\nChairmanNominee Director\nDeepinder Goyal\n2\nChairmanManaging Director & Chief Executive Officer\nSutapa BanerjeeMemberIndependent Director\nAkshant GoyalMemberChief Financial Officer\n1\nSanjeev Bikhc