estimated recoverable amount of CGU. The Group’s CGUs \ncontaining goodwill are as follows:\n1.\n India food ordering and delivery (Goodwill: INR 1,209 crore)\n2. Blink Commerce Private Limited (“BCPL”) (Goodwill: INR 3,507 crore)\n3.\n Orbgen Technologies Private Limited (“OTPL”) (Goodwill: INR 514 crore)\n4. Wasteland Entertainment Private Limited (“WEPL”) (Goodwill: INR 506 crore)\nThe recoverable amount of India food ordering and delivery CGU is determined based on the market value of \nthe Company. The recoverable amounts of BCPL, OTPL and WEPL CGUs are estimated based on the discounted \ncash flows method and comparable companies method. The significant unobservable inputs used in the \nestimation of recoverable amounts are revenue, discount rate, terminal growth rate and market multiple. The \ndiscount rate used for such computations is the weighted average cost of capital 13.60% to 15.60% (March \n31, 2025: 11% to 26%) of the Company which contain such CGU.The estimated recoverable amounts of CGUs \nexceeded their carrying amounts and accordingly, no impairment was recognised. No reasonably possible \nchange in the discount rate or terminal growth rate would cause the recoverable amount to fall shorter than \nthe carrying amount.\n5 Investments (non-current)\n(INR crores)\nParticulars\nAs at March 31, 2026 As at March 31, 2025\nInvestments at fair value through other comprehensive \nincome (F VTOCI)\n(i) \n  Investments in unquoted equity instruments \ndesignated at FVTOCI (fully paid up)\n Investments in Equity Shares\n1 (March 31, 2025 : 1) Equity Share of face value INR \n1,000  each in Hands on Trades Private Limited\n 0  0 \nAdd: fair value through other comprehensive income (0)  -    0  0 \n1 (March 31, 2025 : 1) Equity Share of face value INR 1  \neach in Curefit Healthcare Private Limited\n 0  0 \nAdd: fair value through other comprehensive income 0  0  0  0 \n4,35,54,308 (March 31, 2025 : 9,824) Equity shares of face \nvalue INR 10 each in Shiprocke